The tea and bun maska are in front of me.
I take a sip of the tea.
The tea is sweet and strong.
The bun is very soft.
There is plenty of butter in it.
I break a piece of the bun.
I dip that piece in the tea.
The taste is absolutely amazing!
I look outside the window.
There is a lot of crowd on the street outside.
A waiter comes near my table.
"Dada, could I get a glass of water?" I ask him.
"Yes madam," he says.
He gives me the water.
"Thank you," I say.
I drink my tea again.
This is the true Mumbai experience.
I like this place a lot.
